OL,3,GNEWSA'We were clueless': How a game of
OL,4,Arock, paper, scissors led to a Big Deal
OL,5,Afor fast-learning art duo
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpoiler warning: This article contains
OL,8,Fdetails of the final episode of The Big
OL,9,FDeal with Steph McGovern
OL,11,FTwo west Belfast pals who had never
OL,12,Fbefore set foot in a gallery have been
OL,13,Fcrowned champions of a new BBC art
OL,14,Fcompetition series.
OL,16,FGavin Burns and Liam Martin, who said
OL,17,Fthey were clueless about art, scooped
OL,18,F#50,000 in art during Wednesday night's
OL,19,Fgrand final of The Big Deal with Steph
OL,20,FMcGovern.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
